,"x":3,"y":17},{"type":19,"army":1,"x":22,"y":17},{"type":60,"army":1,"x":33,"y":17,"level":8},{"type":38,"army":0,"x":1,"y":18},{"type":1,"army":0,"x":7,"y":18},{"type":8,"army":1,"x":28,"y":18},{"type":9,"army":1,"x":37,"y":18},{"type":51,"army":1,"x":41,"y":18},{"type":0,"army":1,"x":31,"y":19},{"type":3,"army":0,"x":2,"y":20},{"type":0,"army":1,"x":35,"y":20},{"type":0,"army":0,"x":5,"y":21},{"type":0,"army":1,"x":29,"y":21},{"type":50,"army":1,"x":39,"y":21},{"type":16,"army":0,"x":1,"y":22},{"type":3,"army":1,"x":32,"y":22},{"type":0,"army":1,"x":36,"y":22},{"type":1,"army":0,"x":3,"y":23},{"type":9,"army":1,"x":30,"y":24},{"type":8,"army":1,"x":38,"y":24},{"type":9,"army":0,"x":7,"y":25},{"type":8,"army":1,"x":34,"y":25},{"type":2,"army":0,"x":4,"y":26},{"type":8,"army":0,"x":2,"y":28}],"arrivals":[{"turn":5,"army":1,"units":[{"type":33,"x":44,"y":17},{"type":39,"x":44,"y":14},{"type":39,"x":44,"y":20},{"type":49,"x":43,"y":11},{"type":49,"x":43,"y":23}]}],"objective":{"kind":"destroyType","type":60},"general":{"x":3,"y":17},"turnLimit":20,"cap":14,"music":22,"briefing":"A comet crossing high Earth orbit, two days out from Olympos.\n\nCommander Lysa Vane has sent us an invitation. No ambush this time, no minefield: she is waiting in the open with her squadron, in front of the comet, and she has told the whole Directorate where she is. Kessrin's best pilot wants the duel she was denied at the magnetic river.\n\nShe will have it. Every road to Olympos passes within reach of her squadron, and as long as she flies, Kessrin has an answer to anything we try.\n\nThe comet's tail is her friend: nothing inside it can be targeted. Fight her in open space, from two sides, and do not let her pick the ground.\n\nHer flagship and its escort are coming up behind her. Destroy her Talos before they arrive.","goal":"Destroy Commander Vane's Directorate Talos within 20 turns. If the general falls, it is over.","routes":[{"prio":1,"x":30,"y":17},{"prio":1,"x":27,"y":14},{"prio":1,"x":27,"y":26},{"prio":1,"x":22,"y":18},{"prio":1,"x":18,"y":20},{"prio":1,"x":20,"y":24},{"prio":1,"x":33,"y":21},{"prio":1,"x":24,"y":13}],"chapter":"Chapter 9 · The comet, high Earth orbit","strategy":["Vane's Talos is the only one on the map: destroy it and the battle is won, whatever else is left.","Use the asteroid belts in the middle as cover and close in from two sides. She is level 8: wear her down with several attackers, never one at a time.","Keep away from the comet's tail in the north: a machine inside it can't be targeted, and Vane will use it if you fight her there.","Her Lobsters and Cranes will go for your weakest machines. Keep the Selene and the general behind the mecha line.","Her flagship escort, a Hastur and two cruisers, arrives from the east on turn 6. Have her surrounded before then."],"plan":[{"n":2,"path":[[7,15],[15,17],[24,17],[31,17]]},{"n":2,"path":[[7,23],[18,22],[26,25],[32,21]]},{"n":3,"at":[20,4],"note":"comet tail"},{"n":5,"at":[43,17],"note":"Escort T6"}],"comms":[{"speaker":"vane","text":"No gates, no walls, no Marshal. Just you, me, and a comet. Come and take your turn, General."},{"speaker":"sato","text":"She's left her flagship behind to make a point. It'll be here by the sixth day. So should we be done by then."},{"speaker":"ruess","text":"Mind the tail. Anything inside it can't be targeted, ours or hers. She knows that better than we do."},{"speaker":"kessrin","text":"Lysa. You have one task, and a comet to do it in. Do not make me watch you fail."},{"speaker":"vane","text":"He never could stand to watch. That's the difference between us."}]}